menuconfig WOLFPSA
	bool "wolfPSA Crypto engine (PSA API over wolfCrypt + wolfHSM)"
	depends on WOLFTRUST_WOLFHSM_CLIENT
	depends on !MBEDTLS
	depends on !BUILD_WITH_TFM
	help
	  Link the lib/wolfPSA submodule into the Zephyr image and expose
	  the PSA Crypto API on top of wolfCrypt. The wolfPSA glue calls
	  wolfPSA_SetDefaultDevID(WH_DEV_ID) in its SYS_INIT hook so every
	  psa_*() call routes through the wolfHSM client (registered by
	  the wolfhsm-client module) and across the CMSE boundary into
	  the secure side. Mutually exclusive with Zephyr's bundled
	  mbedTLS PSA front-end and TF-M.
